SAM2.1 model architecture, original checkpoints and the SAM2 decoder are from
Meta's Segment Anything 2 (https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam2),
Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates, licensed under Apache 2.0.

The release weights derive from the official SAM2.1 Hiera T/S/B+/L checkpoints.
SGHAQuant adds grouped Hadamard transforms, quantized encoder weights and
CUDA inference kernels. The SAM2 dependency is pinned in requirements.txt.

SAM ViT-B/L/H model files derive from Meta's Segment Anything checkpoints
(https://github.com/facebookresearch/segment-anything), licensed under Apache 2.0.

DINOv3 model files and their derivatives retain the DINOv3 License, reproduced
in licenses/DINOv3-LICENSE.md and included in each DINOv3 weight archive.
Original model: Meta's DINOv3 ViT-L/16, LVD-1689M pretrained checkpoint.
